# Nothing generated belongs in here. The stack is compose files and a script.
*.log

# Holds a credential to the customer's own deployment, and the secrets
# `diffuse-chat up` generates. Never commit it.
.env

# The overlay `up` writes when the deployment is on this machine, and the one
# an operator may write for themselves. Both belong to the machine they are on,
# not to the repository: `compose.generated.yaml` is rewritten on every `up`,
# and an override carries addresses that are true of one network.
compose.generated.yaml
compose.override.yaml
